      "content": "I hear how heavy and isolating that feeling of being a \"ghost\" can be when the world seems so vast and unfeeling.\nIt is okay to feel that the landscape feels more permanent than you do for a moment, but it is a feeling that can change when you connect with the support of a trusted counselor.\nYou don't have to navigate this permanent emptiness alone; a mental health professional can help you find ways to feel more grounded and seen right here with the wind at your back.",
